<body>

<!-- COVER -->
<div class="cover">
  <div class="cover-label">Workforce Intelligence Report</div>
  <h1>AI Impact on the Global Job Market: Risk, Salary &amp; Skills Trend Analysis</h1>
  <p class="cover-subtitle">A comprehensive examination of how AI automation risk, salary dynamics, skill demand, and job survival prospects are evolving across roles, countries, and experience levels from 2015 to 2035.</p>
  <div class="cover-meta">
    <div class="cover-meta-item">
      <span class="cover-meta-label">Analysis Period</span>
      <span class="cover-meta-value">2015 – 2035</span>
    </div>
    <div class="cover-meta-item">
      <span class="cover-meta-label">Data Records</span>
      <span class="cover-meta-value">12,343 Observations</span>
    </div>
    <div class="cover-meta-item">
      <span class="cover-meta-label">Geographies</span>
      <span class="cover-meta-value">6 Countries</span>
    </div>
    <div class="cover-meta-item">
      <span class="cover-meta-label">Job Roles</span>
      <span class="cover-meta-value">10 Titles</span>
    </div>
    <div class="cover-meta-item">
      <span class="cover-meta-label">Audience</span>
      <span class="cover-meta-value">Executive Leadership &amp; Workforce Strategists</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- TOC NAV -->
<nav class="toc">
  <a href="#executive-overview">Executive Overview</a>
  <a href="#automation-risk">Automation Risk Landscape</a>
  <a href="#salary-trends">Salary Trends &amp; Segmentation</a>
  <a href="#skills-demand">Skills Demand &amp; Future-Proofing</a>
  <a href="#job-survival">Job Survival &amp; Market Outlook</a>
  <a href="#recommendations">Strategic Recommendations</a>
</nav>

<div class="container">

<!-- =============================================
     SECTION 1: EXECUTIVE OVERVIEW
     ============================================= -->
<section class="section" id="executive-overview">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-tag">Section 1</div>
    <h2>Executive Overview</h2>
    <p class="lead">Five critical findings that every executive and workforce strategist should act on now.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- KPI summary strip -->
  <div class="kpi-grid">
    <div class="kpi-card">
      <div class="kpi-label">Avg AI Risk Score (2035 proj.)</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">0.51</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub"><span class="kpi-trend-up">+72%</span> vs 2015 baseline (0.30)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card" style="border-top-color: var(--amber);">
      <div class="kpi-label">High-Risk Roles in Dataset</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">18.6%</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">2,294 of 12,343 records</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card" style="border-top-color: var(--green);">
      <div class="kpi-label">Median Salary Growth</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">+52%</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">$24K (2015) → $37K (2035)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card" style="border-top-color: var(--teal);">
      <div class="kpi-label">Jobs with Survival Class ≥ 1</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">89.0%</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">11,988 of 12,343 records</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card" style="border-top-color: var(--red);">
      <div class="kpi-label">At-Risk Jobs (2035 proj.)</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">16.3%</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Up from 8.9% in 2015</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Executive findings panel -->
  <div class="exec-overview">
    <h2>Five Critical Takeaways for Executive Leadership</h2>
    <div class="exec-findings">
      <div class="exec-finding">
        <div class="exec-finding-num">FINDING 01</div>
        <div class="exec-finding-title">Automation risk has nearly doubled over 20 years</div>
        <div class="exec-finding-body">Average AI risk score rose from 0.30 in 2015 to a projected 0.51 by 2035 — a 70% increase. By 2035, nearly 1 in 6 roles is classified as at-risk (survival class 0), up from roughly 1 in 11 in 2015. The acceleration is continuous with no plateau in sight.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="exec-finding">
        <div class="exec-finding-num">FINDING 02</div>
